    "title": "Community group to hold meeting in City of Cedarburg on Thursday, Aug. 20",
    "text": "Community group to hold meeting in City of Cedarburg on Thursday, Aug. 20\nBy\nS. D. CanoOn Thursday, Aug. 20, the Rotary Club of Cedarburg-Grafton will conduct its general club meeting in the City of Cedarburg, organized by a community group.\nThe meeting is set to take place at the Rotary Club of Cedarburg-Grafton location and will start at 12 p.m.\nCommunity members interested in attending are encouraged to participate and engage in local discussions.",
